    "text": "*men* (I), *sen* (you), *ol* (he, she), *biz* (we), *siz* (you, plural or polite), *olar* (they). To say what someone is, put the pronoun and the word side by side: *Men talyp*, I am a student. Keep the pronoun: nothing else says who you mean.",
